OL,5,G2145 The Essay: This Sounding Isle
OL,6,     FKate Kennedy follows in the
OL,7,     Ffootsteps of composer Havergal
OL,8,     FBrian from the Staffordshire
OL,9,     FPotteries, to seek connections
OL,10,     Fbetween a place and the music it
OL,11,     Fhas inspired.
OL,12,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,13,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,14,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,15,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,16,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,17,     Feverything in between.
